{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "batch_norm_eval_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[N, C, H, W]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "strided contiguous 1D",
          "nullable": true,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "strided contiguous 1D",
          "nullable": true,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_mean",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "strided contiguous 1D",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "running_var",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[C]",
          "layout": "strided contiguous 1D",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": 1e-05,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as input [N, C, H, W]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句：x = self.batch_norm(x)（推理模式，training=False）",
        "每个通道 c 独立计算：scale = weight[c] / sqrt(running_var[c] + eps)；shift = bias[c] - running_mean[c] * scale；output[n,c,h,w] = input[n,c,h,w] * scale + shift",
        "weight 为 batch_norm.weight, bias 为 batch_norm.bias, running_mean/running_var 来自缓冲区",
        "如果 weight 为 None，则 scale=1/sqrt(running_var[c]+eps)；如果 bias 为 None，则 shift=-running_mean[c]*scale；本任务中 affine=True, bias=True，weight/bias 均存在且形状为 [C]",
        "eps 默认 1e-05，与 BatchNorm2d 默认一致",
        "输出与输入 shape、dtype、device、stride 相同"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "clamp_min_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "same as reference step",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "min_val",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": null,
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as input"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句：x = torch.clamp(x, min=self.min_val)",
        "逐元素计算 output[i] = max(input[i], min_val)，且 min_val 可能为负/零/正，不能简化为 ReLU",
        "输出与输入 shape、dtype、device、stride 相同"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.batch_norm(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "调用 BatchNorm2d 在训练=False 模式下对输入 [16,64,512,256] float32 做归一化",
        "对每个通道 c 应用 affine 变换：y = (x - running_mean[c]) / sqrt(running_var[c] + eps) * weight[c] + bias[c]",
        "weight/bias 为模型参数，running_mean/running_var 为缓冲区；eps=1e-05",
        "输出与输入 shape、dtype、device 相同"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = torch.clamp(x, min=self.min_val)",
      "semantics": [
        "对 batch_norm 输出逐元素执行 max(x, self.min_val)",
        "self.min_val 来自构造参数，此处为 0.0",
        "输出与输入 shape、dtype、device 相同"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回 clamp 后的张量，shape [16,64,512,256], dtype float32, device cuda:0"
      ]
    }
  ]
}